<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83803" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλημμέλ-εια</span></b> , ἡ, prop.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>mistake in music, false
				note,</i> but in usage, metaph., <i>fault, error,</i> esp. in
			taste or judgement, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				22d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ π. καὶ ἀμουσίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					691a
				</span></i>
			; <i>faultiness</i> in metre, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.396d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσέβεια ἡ περὶ θεοὺς π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>VV</u>
					1251a31
				</span></i>
			 (hence in <i><span class="en">
				LXX
			</span></i>, <i>trespass, sin, Le.</i><i><span class="en">
				6.5
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς πλημμέλειαν</span> for
			a <i>sin</i>-offering, ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.18
			</span></i>): freq. in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ π. αἱ ἐν τοῖς πράγμασιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					8.56
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
